<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  v1.1c task 6: `anima_wallpaper.xml` carried no `android:thumbnail`, so the
  system live-wallpaper picker showed the generic broken-image placeholder next
  to "Anima — твоё существо". Found by opening the picker, which is what a new
  owner does before they ever see the wallpaper itself.

  Same logic as the launcher icon (task 2.1): the thumbnail cannot follow a
  device seed, so it shows the thing that is true for everyone and is not yet
  anybody — the shell, with light in the crack, on the wallpaper's own night.
-->
